<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">55块2 · 我的</view><view class="title">设置</view><view wx:if="{{config}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">计划参数</view><view class="list-row"><text>每日额度</text><text class="value">¥{{config.dailyBudget}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>日薪</text><text class="value">¥{{config.salaryPerDay / 100}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>计薪周期</text><text class="secondary-text">21日 — 20日</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>截止日</text><text class="secondary-text">{{config.deadline}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>最低目标</text><text class="value">¥{{config.goalMinimum}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">结算节奏</view><view class="list-row"><text>{{mode === 'daily' ? '每日结算' : '三天一结'}}</text><switch checked="{{mode === 'three-day'}}" color="#171717" bindchange="toggleMode" /></view><view class="caption">三天一结时，批次首日一次划入 ¥{{config.dailyBudgetYuan}}，第 3 天统一结算。已有未结批次时暂不能切换。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">预算情景</view><view class="scenario-grid"><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '省' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="省" bindtap="selectScenario">省　¥48.29</button><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '中' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="中" bindtap="selectScenario">中　¥55.19</button><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '松' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="松" bindtap="selectScenario">松　¥63.73</button></view><view class="caption">情景只决定“往后按多少花”：已执行期次的四笔划转以实际流水为准、不会被追溯改写，未执行期次与储蓄目标按新日额度重算；已封账的日结算按当天真实划入金额退款，切换情景不会退错钱。计划截止日后账本只读，情景同样不再调整。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">金额校准</view><view class="caption">记录差额并计入账户展示余额，不覆盖原始流水。</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{accountOptions}}" value="{{acctIndex}}" bindchange="selectAcct"><view class="account-picker">校准账户：{{accountOptions[acctIndex]}}（{{acct}}）</view></picker><input class="adjust-input" type="digit" placeholder="真实余额，例如 1200.00" value="{{realBalance}}" bindinput="inputReal" /><input class="adjust-input" type="digit" placeholder="账面余额，例如 1180.00" value="{{bookBalance}}" bindinput="inputBook" /><input class="adjust-input" placeholder="备注（可选）" value="{{adjustNote}}" bindinput="inputNote" /><button class="button" bindtap="saveAdjust">保存校准</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">分类管理</view><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="category-admin"><text>{{item.mark}}　{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.custom}}" class="delete-category" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeCategory">删除</text></view><input class="adjust-input" placeholder="新分类名称" value="{{categoryName}}" bindinput="inputCategoryName" /><input class="adjust-input" placeholder="单字标记（可选）" value="{{categoryMark}}" bindinput="inputCategoryMark" /><button class="button secondary" bindtap="addCategory">添加分类</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">备份与恢复</view><view class="caption">{{backupView.summary}}。备份是完整快照（含封账状态、结算模式与期初余额），换机时把备份文件发到聊天记录，再在新手机里选择它恢复；CSV 只用于查看和 Excel。</view><view class="caption">{{backupView.lastBackupText}}<text wx:if="{{backupView.lastRestoreText}}">　·　{{backupView.lastRestoreText}}</text></view><button class="button" bindtap="backupNow">备份到文件</button><button class="button secondary backup-gap" bindtap="restoreFromFile">从聊天记录选择备份恢复</button><button class="button secondary backup-gap" bindtap="restoreFromClipboard">从剪贴板恢复</button><button wx:if="{{backupView.canUndoRestore}}" class="button secondary backup-gap" bindtap="undoRestore">撤销上次恢复，回到恢复前</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view><view class="caption">所有流水保存在本机，不使用云服务。导出文件写进小程序本地目录，仅在打开/分享时经系统处理。</view><view class="list-row"><text>已记录支出</text><text class="value">{{expenseCount}} 笔</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>全部账务流水</text><text class="value">{{eventCount}} 条</text></view><button class="button secondary" bindtap="openLedger">打开全量流水</button><button class="button secondary export-gap" bindtap="exportCsv">打开全量流水文件</button><button class="button secondary" bindtap="exportIcs">打开发薪日历 ICS</button><button class="button reset-button" bindtap="resetData">重置演示数据</button></view></view>
